  "title": "Chapter 7: Mughal Empire",
  "order": 7,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "op8boji",
      "content": "The Mughal Empire was one of the most powerful empires in Indian history. It was founded by Babur in 1526 after defeating Ibrahim Lodi in the First Battle of Panipat. The Mughal period is extremely important for competitive examinations such as BANKING , BANKING , NDA and various State level exams."
    },
