      "content": "8. Shah Jahan"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ddhhtoi",
      "content": "• Period known for architectural achievements."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "uyqakn3",
      "content": "• Built the Taj Mahal in memory of Mumtaz Mahal."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "b9wq3db",
      "content": "• Also built Red Fort and Jama Masjid in Delhi."
    },
    {
      "id": "3dbov5u",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9. Aurangzeb"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "q1qo4di",
      "content": "• Last powerful Mughal ruler."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "r6srmis",
      "content": "• Expanded Mughal territory to its maximum extent."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lguk9r2",
      "content": "• Reimposed the Jizya tax on non-Muslims."
    },
    {
      "id": "0d1a4j6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "10. Mughal Art and Architecture"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tp70bus",
      "content": "• Taj Mahal is one of the Seven Wonders of the World."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "iw2z5xp",
      "content": "• Red Fort in Delhi was built by Shah Jahan."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5mf1ki2",
      "content": "• Mughal architecture combines Persian, Indian and Islamic styles."
    },
    {
      "id": "t84u0r1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "11. Decline of the Mughal Empire"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tuma1qc",
      "content": "• Weak successors after Aurangzeb."
    },
